@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "Not pending" as Consumed

[*] --> Pending : host reports\nboot event pending
[*] --> Consumed : host reports\nno pending event
Pending --> Pending : scan rejected\n(event retained)
Pending --> Consumed : first successfully\ncommitted scan\n(restart_event = true)
Consumed --> Consumed : later scans\n(restart_event = false)
Consumed --> Consumed : program replacement\n(no new boot event)

note bottom of Pending
  restart_reason stays fixed for the run
  (Unknown when the host has no evidence).
end note
@enduml
